# sequence with transition conditions. Competing with continuous trajectory model (H2a).
# H2b is more fertile but less parsimonious. Current v3.2 implements the simpler
# sit:hasTrajectory/sit:hasChronicity approach as a stepping stone."

# Hypothesis H3 (Req 14): Outcome pathways
# rdfs:comment "PROPOSED (REIFIED): Link frames to downstream health outcomes via
